speechtext:
In so far as the Post Office Department is concerned:	1. (a) Twelve;
(b) Alberton, one; Charlottetown, two; Kensington, one; Montague, one; Port Borden, three; Souris East, one; Summerside, two; Slemon Park, one.
2. At present none, but a modification programme is expected to be completed by 10 May, 1969.
